From 236384717bc16c77b45ce2013310da2fbf142271 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Denguinho <k@local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 19:05:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CUDA: GQA-batched small-batch flash-attention vector kernel

Matches the prepared upstream branch exactly (kernel + SM-fill parallelism
floor + test coverage): one block serves a GQA group for quantized-KV
Q->ne[1] <= 2 on cc < 89, skipped when the shrunken grid cannot fill the
GPU (fixes the -2.4% shallow-depth regression of the first version).
---
